{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790625900, "covers_from": "2026-09-28T20:05:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-28T20:06:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790625960, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-28T20:05:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47329, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "不要再砍樹啦！有沒有什麼辦法立刻停止台北市政府砍樹‼️台北市每顆樹都已在那裡數十年,憑甚麼把它砍掉？", "display_name": "松山代表 No.47,329", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-28T20:05:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2045, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "我覺得捷運站裡及車廂的冷氣不足，有時雖然下雨沒那麼熱，但站內反而因此人非常多，冷氣不夠很影響搭乘品質", "display_name": "信義代表 No.2,045", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-28T20:05:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36385, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "捷運的扶手都不見了，只能用拉拉環的，但對小孩來說太高了根本很難拉到，即使是成人用拉的也比較不穩！", "display_name": "文山代表 No.36,385", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-28T20:05:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 33155, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "中山北路五段劍潭山登山口要有固定的清潔人員來打掃，並加裝監視器，以防登山客亂丟垃圾，謝謝！", "display_name": "士林代表 No.33,155", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 2045, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.2,045", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 36385, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.36,385", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 33155, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.33,155", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 10372, "sprite_key": "pen